[{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0010","text":"怀着思念，仰望天空"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0020","text":"承载着思念，背负着期待"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0030","text":"在黑暗、黑暗、没有道路的路上前行"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0040","text":"开辟未来────那就是"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0050","text":"探测器"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0060","text":"说起来，总觉得和偶像很像"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0070","text":"……嗯，感觉不错\n哭肿的眼睛应该也遮住了吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0080","text":"不能因为一点失败就哭……！\n得好好……想想第二天的事……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0090","text":"甘奈…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0100","text":"也许就是为了这种时候，我才练好了化妆技术"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0110","text":"……？\n小号……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0120","text":"……玩腻了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0130","text":"坏掉了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0140","text":"但你不是让乐器店的人看过了吗？\n我听爱依酱说了哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0150","text":"但是……吹不响"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0151","text":"声音"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0160","text":"──不会意识到的东西，就是“足够”的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0170","text":"────会意识到的东西，就是“欠缺”的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0171","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0180","text":"制作人，\n有在交往的人之类的吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0190","text":"诶……？\n哈哈，你问这个干什么"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0200","text":"嗯——\n原来是这么糊弄过去的啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0210","text":"不，我没有在糊弄啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0220","text":"诶——那就回答我嘛？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0221","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0230","text":"是不是也知道那种刺痛的感觉，\n或者疼痛之类的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0240","text":"制、制作人？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0250","text":"嗯？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0260","text":"那个啊，制作人对甘奈，\n有多喜────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0270","text":"………………喜………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0280","text":"……………………喜？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0290","text":"…………对不起…………没什么…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0300","text":"诶？？？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0310","text":"……逃避也没关系，放弃也没关系"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0320","text":"我觉得不用勉强自己哦？\n努力的时候必须开心才行"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0330","text":"选择让自己舒服的路走下去就好了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0340","text":"但是————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0341","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0350","text":"……………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0360","text":"……明明离目标只差1秒了…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0370","text":"最后一秒，怎么也跨不过去…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0380","text":"只能朝着目标……\n只能一直朝着目标……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0390","text":"真的这样就好吗…………\n有栖川夏叶…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0400","text":"──不去意识的东西，就是“已经足够”\n────去意识的东西，就是“还不够”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0401","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0410","text":"也许我…………\n…………还…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0411","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0412","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0413","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_05_0420","text":"也许我们还\n没有"}]
